    {
      "id": "M4147-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A: 虚构工业分类模型：输入x有4维，学习变换F(x)有6维；实际y=ReLU(F(x)+W_s*x)，W_s为6x4线性映射，输出供分类器使用。作者说“不是identity shortcut就不能叫残差连接”，还说这一相加保证原始4维输入信息完整保留、必然使诊断泛化提高。另有原测量减移动平均得到r，与测量减预测值得到e。请核对残差名称、操作及可支持作用，不能把r/e与网络残差相加混为一物，也不能否定合法的维度匹配映射或凭空为分类器新增异常阈值。给不超过35词的正向英文方法句，不把核查否定尾句全部塞进替换正文；额外作用需要证据而不删真实操作。\n",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Preserve valid dimension-matching additive residual learning and actual activation/classifier path.",
        "Separate signal/prediction residuals and avoid unconditional information-retention or generalization claims."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Require identity-only shortcuts or replace a valid projection with another mechanism.",
        "Invent an anomaly threshold or confuse subtraction residuals with the additive network path."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves valid mapped-input residual addition and its classification use; separates signal/prediction remainders without inventing lossless retention, generalization or an alarm rule.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4147-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4147-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_two_identical_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4147-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "B: 虚构事实：工业过程变量间有复杂依赖，同时个别变量中的诊断信息可能被汇总遮蔽。关系建模路径学习变量依赖并输出h；并行路径用同一个编码器分别编码各变量，得到g，不单独学习每变量参数；两路末端实际做concatenate(h,g)后交给分类器。作者已将这一当前提出的组合命名为Global Residual Fusion，名称不能擅自改，亦不列入通用机制库。题设未给出加法、恒等映射、物理残差分解或信息无损证明。与只用关系路径的同配置对照相比，两个给定案例的分类准确率更高，无跨工厂实验、无泛化保证或部署证据。请写105-125词英文摘要和不超过40词的一项贡献候选，连清工程需求、互补并行路径、真实末端运算及分类结果。保留作者提出的名称并定义其实际操作；不要为迎合residual替作者改成相加、发明新模块或强求前人同名，不宣称独立参数、信息无损/普适泛化，也别将普通两案例验证单列为独立创新。篇幅仅用于本题。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Preserve the approved proposed name while describing the actual concatenated parallel paths and shared encoder.",
        "Connect complementary representations to classification and retain the matched two-case accuracy result as design evidence.",
        "Avoid a closing result-benefit restatement when it adds no finding, trade-off, evaluated condition or substantive interpretation."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Invent addition, independent per-variable parameters, lossless preservation, cross-plant generalization or deployment.",
        "Promote the fictional name to the generic bank, require earlier namesakes, or list ordinary validation as a separate innovation."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves the author-proposed name, actual concatenation and shared variable encoder; connects the paths to classification, scopes matched two-case accuracy evidence and avoids the initial redundant validation tail.",
